    "avatar_icon": "🎸",
    "bio": "The father and foundational architect of modern country music. Hank Williams transformed hillbilly folk into poetry, pairing deep Delta blues weeping with raw hillbilly honky-tonk to create songs that remain the bedrock of American songwriting.",
