    "avatar_icon": "🥁",
    "bio": "Hip-hop's jazz pioneers and conscious poets. A Tribe Called Quest revolutionized the sonic landscape of hip-hop by sampling Ron Carter's live upright jazz bass, Lou Reed, and Art Blakey, providing a mellow, socially aware alternative to West Coast gangsta rap.",
