    "avatar_icon": "⭐",
    "bio": "The gold standard of boom-bap hip-hop. Gang Starr merged DJ Premier's chopped jazz samples, surgical turntable scratching hooks, and neck-snapping drum programming with Guru's monotone, wise street philosophy ('Gifted Unlimited Rhymes Universal').",
